ailable. International delivery is charged at a $50 flat rate, Lagos delivery is complimentary for valid addresses, and delivery outside Lagos is charged at a single ₦15,000 flat rate.","image":"/brand/products/button/ndb1/ndb1-studio-registered.webp","images":["/brand/products/button/ndb1/ndb1-studio-registered.webp","/brand/products/button/ndb1/ndb1-front.webp","/brand/products/button/ndb1/ndb1-mid.webp","/brand/products/button/ndb1/ndb1-angle.webp","/brand/products/button/ndb1/ndb1-back.webp"],"darkPage":true}}],["$","$Lc","nd1",{"product":{"slug":"nd1","name":"ND1","edition":"Cobalt Seamless Edition","meaning":"Direction","palette":"#0D3B66","pageText":"#F7F3E8","pageMuted":"#C9D9E7","pagePanel":"#154D7A","family":"buttonless","colorName":"Blue","colorValue":"#0D3B66","modelName":"Kharn","story":"ND1 lets blue move without interruption. With an uninterrupted front, the front reads as one confident plane, creating a disciplined silhouette that feels calm, direct, and easy to wear.","storyKicker":"ND1 / Direction","storyTitle":"An uninterrupted blue line for the man moving forward.","occasion":"travel, modern work, destination dinners, and refined everyday wear","details":"Complete Two-Piece Outfit. Top And Trousers Included. A cobalt collarless short-sleeve top with a clean open collar, uninterrupted front, coordinated tapered trouser, practical pockets, and gold ỌNUỌRA signatures.","fit":"A smooth relaxed-tailored torso falls cleanly from the shoulder. The stretch trouser allows room through the seat and thigh before a neat taper at the hem.","fabricCare":"Breathable four-way stretch suiting. Gentle cold wash, reshape and dry flat, then cool iron inside out. Avoid bleach and high heat.","price":"$$120","delivery":"Worldwide delivery is available. International delivery is charged at a $50 flat rate, Lagos delivery is complimentary for valid addresses, and delivery outside Lagos is charged at a single ₦15,000 flat rate.","image":"/brand/products/buttonless/nd1/nd1-studio-registered.webp","images":["/brand/products/buttonless/nd1/nd1-studio-registered.webp","/brand/products/buttonless/nd1/nd1-front.webp","/brand/products/buttonless/nd1/nd1-mid.webp","/brand/products/buttonless/nd1/nd1-angle.webp","/brand/products/buttonless/nd1/nd1-back.webp"],"darkPage":true}}]]}]]}]
